{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","max_tokens":1536,"stream":true,"system":"Keep the answer short.","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"A synthetic widget has 17 blue beads and 9 green beads. It loses 5 blue beads, then doubles its green beads. How many beads remain? Answer in one sentence."},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me work through this step by step:\n\nStarting beads:\n- Blue beads: 17\n- Green beads: 9\n- Total: 17 + 9 = 26\n\nAfter losing 5 blue beads:\n- Blue beads: 17 - 5 = 12\n- Green beads: 9\n- Total: 12 + 9 = 21\n\nAfter doubling green beads:\n- Blue beads: 12\n- Green beads: 9 × 2 = 18\n- Total: 12 + 18 = 30\n\nSo the answer is 30 beads.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"After losing 5 blue beads (leaving 12 blue) and doubling its green beads (to 18 green), the widget has 30 beads remaining."}]},{"role":"user","content":"Now reply exactly OK."}],"thinking":{"type":"enabled","budget_tokens":1024,"display":"summarized"}}